WEBVTT

NOTE Silent video. Cues are the on-screen step captions; the terminal text is in the transcript.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.467
Concepts nobody defined: Pages name concepts freely. Retry and Quota have no term page, so term check fails: exit 1.

2
00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:15.533
term fill --offline: --offline sends nothing off the machine. With no local model, term fill writes a stub per concept.

3
00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:21.100
What is left to write: No undefined terms left. check now names the two definitions a person, or a model, still writes.

4
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:33.233
Questions pinned to answers: 3 concepts, all from the termbase. A local model pins each page's question to its answer's lines.

5
00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:43.367
The answer changed: Edit the pinned line, and graph check flags the question: its answer is no longer there.

